{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663425900713396526","title":"测试开发工程师（电池）-2027校招","description":"1、根据产品需求、软件功能list，输出并维护产品测试用例，组织测试用例评审；\n2、根据测试用例执行电池及充电产品功能、性能测试，输出测测试报告及组织评审；\n3、结合AI大模型，主导开发自动化测试工具及上位机软件，并推动项目落地，提升测试效率和覆盖率；\n4、针对测试发现的问题及时提单到jira系统，跟进并推动问题分析及解决；\n5、学习业内先进测试方法、测试管理系统、测试设备并定期输输出技术分享，保证团队测试能力的先进性。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，计算机/电子/通信/电气/自动化类相关专业背景；\n2、具备电路基础知识，了解基本的阻容器件，半导体器件，通信协议等工作原理；\n3、有AI辅助开发经验、或了解python/C/C++等编程语言者优先；\n4、有较强的责任感和自驱力，善于沟通，做事细心严谨，良好的团队合作精神及较强的抗压能力。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784280452694,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663425900713019694","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[{"id":"7673730692275407113","name":{"name":"置顶","en_name":"置顶","i18n_name":"置顶"},"style":"{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(245, 74, 69, 0.2)\",\"color\":\"rgba(98, 28, 24, 1)\"}","scope_list":[{"id":"7673730692275439881","name":{"name":"校招中文官网仅职位","i18n_name":"校